(368, 'Giao diện chính của App Inventor bao gồm những phần nào?', '1455', 19, '2025-04-22 11:08:18', '2025-04-22 11:08:18'),
(369, 'Thành phần Button trong App Inventor có tác dụng gì?', '1461', 19, '2025-04-22 11:08:18', '2025-04-22 11:08:18'),
(370, 'Trong App Inventor, để thay đổi màu nền của một Button, bạn cần điều chỉnh thuộc tính nào?', '1464', 19, '2025-04-22 11:08:18', '2025-04-22 11:08:18'),
(371, 'Thành phần nào trong App Inventor cho phép người dùng nhập văn bản?', '1468', 19, '2025-04-22 11:08:18', '2025-04-22 11:08:18'),
(372, 'Để hiển thị văn bản thông báo cho người dùng trong App Inventor, thành phần nào nên được sử dụng?', '1473', 19, '2025-04-22 11:08:18', '2025-04-22 11:08:18'),
(373, 'Để tạo biến trong App Inventor, bạn cần sử dụng khối lệnh từ nhóm nào?', '1478', 19, '2025-04-22 11:08:18', '2025-04-22 11:08:18'),
(374, 'Khối lệnh vòng lặp \"for each number from ... to ... by ...\" trong App Inventor có màu gì?', '1480', 19, '2025-04-22 11:08:18', '2025-04-22 11:08:18'),
(375, 'Khi muốn thực hiện một hành động khi nút được nhấn, bạn cần sử dụng khối lệnh nào?', '1485', 19, '2025-04-22 11:08:18', '2025-04-22 11:08:18'),
(376, 'Trong App Inventor, để tạo một danh sách, bạn sử dụng khối lệnh từ nhóm nào?', '1487', 19, '2025-04-22 11:08:18', '2025-04-22 11:08:18'),
(377, 'Khi muốn kiểm tra ứng dụng trực tiếp trên điện thoại trong quá trình phát triển, phương pháp nào sau đây có thể sử dụng trong App Inventor?', '1491', 19, '2025-04-22 11:08:18', '2025-04-22 11:08:18'),
(378, 'Để lưu lại dự án App Inventor cho việc chia sẻ hoặc chỉnh sửa sau này, định dạng file nào được sử dụng?', '1496', 19, '2025-04-22 11:08:18', '2025-04-22 11:08:18'),
(477, '1. Which arrangement of utterances makes a meaningful exchange? \na. Emma: I’ve started using a language learning app.\nb. Jack: Really? Does it actually help?\nc. Jack: What are you doing to improve your Spanish?\nd. Emma: Yes, it has fun games and daily challenges.\ne. Jack: Wow, sounds fun! I want to try it too.', '1891', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(478, '2. Which arrangement of utterances makes a meaningful exchange? \na. Ben: Oh no! But you studied hard, right?\nb. Ben: I get that. Exams can be tricky even when you\'re prepared.\nc. Sarah: It was tough. I completely blanked on one of the problems.\nd. Sarah: Yeah, I did. But I still felt nervous during the test.\ne. Ben: How was the math test today?', '1898', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(479, '3. Read the paragraph and answer the question.\n(I) The invention of the telephone was one of the most important technological advancements of the 19th century. (II) It allowed people to speak with one another instantly, even if they were far apart. (III) Before the telephone, messages had to be sent by letter or telegram, which could take hours or even days. (IV) The first successful voice transmission happened in 1876, thanks to Alexander Graham Bell.\n\nWhere in the paragraph does the following sentence best fit?\n\"This innovation completely transformed how people communicated over long distances.\"', '1900', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(480, '4. Read the paragraph and answer the question.\nPeople should aim to purchase items with minimal packaging and reuse cups and utensils. Additionally, buying high-quality products helps reduce waste. When low-quality appliances break, many consumers discard THEM and purchase new ones, leading to a waste of resources and energy.\n\nThe word “them” in paragraph two refers to...', '1905', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(481, '5. Choose the correct order of adjectives to complete the sentence:\nShe bought a ______ bag to carry her groceries.', '1908', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(482, '6. Choose the correct word to complete the sentence:\nBurning plastic can be ______ to the environment.', '1912', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(483, '7. Which of the following is not a renewable energy source?', '1917', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(484, '8. Choose the correct connector to complete the sentence: \nSocial media can spread information quickly. ______, it can also spread false news.', '1921', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(485, '9. Which sentence best expresses the same idea as: “False news stories can travel quickly and influence public opinion before they are corrected”?', '1924', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(486, '10. Choose the best option to complete the sentence:\nPeople ______ to improve their reading speed should avoid reading aloud.', '1927', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(487, '11. A metaphor describes something by saying it is something else to make writing more vivid, like calling a difficult problem \"a mountain to climb.\" However, when metaphors are used too often, they become CLICHÉS and lose their impact. Good writers try to avoid CLICHÉS to create fresh, engaging language that keeps their work interesting and meaningful.\n\nThe word \"clichés\" in the passage is closest in meaning to:\n\n', '1933', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(488, '12. Can solar power completely replace fossil fuels? Solar power is clean, safe, and inexpensive. But the idea of replacing fossil fuels with solar power alone is totally unrealistic. Current solar cell technology is not advanced enough. Solar cells are not dependable. They are useless in cloudy and rainy weather as well as at night. Also, they take up too much space. Then they fail to produce sufficient amounts of power.\n\nAccording to the passage, which of the following is TRUE about solar power?\n\n', '1937', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(489, '13. Dragonflies usually eat mosquitoes, flies, and other small insects. Many humans like THEM because they feed on these pests. Dragonflies live near lakes, ponds, streams, and wetlands. Their larvae, known as nymphs, are aquatic.\n\nThe word \"them\" in the paragraph refers to:', '1939', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(490, '14. Jellyfish have long, thin arms called ______, which they use to sting their prey.\n', '1944', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(491, '15. Light pollution is excessive artificial light that brightens the night sky (I). It comes from streetlights, buildings, and outdoor ads (II). This glow blocks stars and disrupts wildlife sleep cycles (III). Scientists classify it into three forms, including skyglow, glare, and light trespass (IV). Many cities now use shielded lights to reduce the problem.\n\nWhere in the paragraph does the following sentence best fit?\n\"These categories help identify solutions effectively.\"', '1950', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(492, '16. Choose the correct word to complete the text below.\nBiodiversity refers to the variety of living organisms within a particular area. During the last 100 years, scientists have seen a great ______ in biodiversity. This means a great loss for humans as the stewards of the planet Earth.\n', '1952', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(493, '17. He decided to switch careers ______ he was no longer passionate about his job.', '1955', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(494, '18. The new law encourages businesses to adopt ______ packaging to reduce waste.', '1960', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(495, '19. His passion for photography led him to pursue a career in ______.', '1965', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(496, '20. She has always admired artists who use their work to express ______ emotions.', '1967', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(497, '21. Which students qualify for one of the 100 “Chuyên Gia Toàn Cầu” scholarships?', '1973', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(498, '22. In 2025, how many Nguyễn Văn Đạo scholarships will FPT University award to talented high school graduates?\n', '1975', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(499, '23. What type of scholarship is awarded to one student from each high school located in Area 1 (Khu vực 1)?', '1980', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(500, '24. In 2025, how many students are expected to receive support through FPT University\'s “Study Now – Pay Later” initiative?', '1985', 20, '2025-05-03 11:11:42', '2025-05-03 11:11:42'),
(501, 'Trong n8n, node nào thường được dùng để gọi API của OpenAI hoặc Gemini?', '1987', 21, '2025-06-12 15:54:40', '2025-06-12 15:54:40'),
(502, 'Để chatbot AI có thể gửi email qua Gmail từ n8n, bạn cần cấu hình node nào?', '1993', 21, '2025-06-12 15:54:40', '2025-06-12 15:54:40'),
(503, 'Chức năng chính của node Webhook trong n8n là gì?', '1996', 21, '2025-06-12 15:54:40', '2025-06-12 15:54:40');
INSERT INTO `question_certification_test` (`id`, `question`, `answer_correct_id`, `certification_test_id`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(504, 'Đâu là một trong những lợi ích khi dùng n8n thay vì code thủ công khi tạo AI Agent?', '2001', 21, '2025-06-12 15:54:40', '2025-06-12 15:54:40'),
(505, 'Để truy xuất và ghi dữ liệu vào Google Sheets, bạn cần quyền gì?', '2004', 21, '2025-06-12 15:54:40', '2025-06-12 15:54:40'),
(506, 'Nếu muốn tạo chuỗi hội thoại với AI (nhớ ngữ cảnh), bạn nên lưu gì?', '2009', 21, '2025-06-12 15:54:40', '2025-06-12 15:54:40'),
(507, 'Khi thiết kế lời nhắc (prompt) để AI hỗ trợ giáo viên soạn giáo án tự động, yếu tố nào dưới đây là quan trọng nhất?', '2013', 21, '2025-06-12 15:54:40', '2025-06-12 15:54:40'),
(508, 'Node “IF” trong n8n có vai trò gì?', '2016', 21, '2025-06-12 15:54:40', '2025-06-12 15:54:40'),
(509, 'Để AI Agent hoạt động tốt với dữ liệu người dùng, bạn cần làm gì?', '2021', 21, '2025-06-12 15:54:40', '2025-06-12 15:54:40'),
(510, 'Nếu muốn chatbot trả lời theo giọng điệu nghiêm túc, bạn cần chỉnh gì trong prompt?', '2024', 21, '2025-06-12 15:54:40', '2025-06-12 15:54:40'),
(511, 'AI có thể hỗ trợ giáo viên THPT như thế nào dưới đây?', '2030', 21, '2025-06-12 15:54:40', '2025-06-12 15:54:40'),
(512, 'Một trong những thách thức lớn nhất khi ứng dụng AI trong giáo dục là:', '2033', 21, '2025-06-12 15:54:40', '2025-06-12 15:54:40'),
(513, '“Prompt” trong ngữ cảnh AI là gì?', '2037', 21, '2025-06-12 15:54:40', '2025-06-12 15:54:40'),
(514, 'Trong kỹ thuật prompt, nguyên tắc nào sau đây là hiệu quả nhất?', '2041', 21, '2025-06-12 15:54:40', '2025-06-12 15:54:40'),
(515, 'Chatbot MyGPT là gì?', '2045', 21, '2025-06-12 15:54:40', '2025-06-12 15:54:40'),
(516, 'Một lợi ích của việc tạo MyGPT dành riêng cho lớp học là:', '2049', 21, '2025-06-12 15:54:40', '2025-06-12 15:54:40'),
(517, 'Khi dùng AI trong giảng dạy, giáo viên cần cẩn trọng nhất với điều gì sau đây?', '2053', 21, '2025-06-12 15:54:40', '2025-06-12 15:54:40'),
(518, 'Thói quen nào dưới đây giúp tăng cường an toàn khi sử dụng công cụ AI?', '2057', 21, '2025-06-12 15:54:40', '2025-06-12 15:54:40'),
(519, 'Trong các ví dụ sau, đâu là cách ứng dụng AI hiệu quả nhất trong dạy học THPT?', '2060', 21, '2025-06-12 15:54:40', '2025-06-12 15:54:40'),
(520, 'Điều nào sau đây không nên làm khi triển khai AI trong trường THPT?', '2065', 21, '2025-06-12 15:54:40', '2025-06-12 15:54:40');
